{'symbol': 'PEG', 'date': '2022-06-08 13:00:00', 'title': 'PSEG LONG ISLAND IS PREPARED FOR SUMMER 2022', 'text': 'UNIONDALE, N.Y. , JUNE 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS THE APPROACHING 10TH ANNIVERSARY OF SUPERSTORM SANDY REMINDS US OF THE EFFECTS WEATHER CAN HAVE ON THE ELECTRIC SYSTEM, PSEG LONG ISLAND IS ANNOUNCING THAT IT IS PREPARED FOR HURRICANE SEASON AND TO MEET PEAK DEMAND DURING EXTREME HEAT SITUATIONS THIS SUMMER.'}